Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there were two,\Nand then three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought if they take me\Nin now, my cat's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My place doesn't allow pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see, I'm the only\None who knows about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Morioka City, Iwate\NPrefecture, in March of 2016,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two people, a young girl and her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were found fatally\Nstabbed in their own home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Morioka Prosecutor's Office indicted\NCode Oe, who lived near the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was charged with\Nfelony murder and robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The events leading to\Nhis arrest were thus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While being questioned by three officers\Non patrol, Code Oe suddenly fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The patrolman chased Oe to his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once inside, the officers\Ndiscovered a knife covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oe was arrested in flagrante delicto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After DNA analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the blood on the blade was revealed\Nto be a match to the victim's DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,O .A.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,consistently denied all charges Asked\Nto explain the knife, he insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little hard to believe,\Ndon't you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't flee questioning\Nbecause of his cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fled because he was guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had been wrongly detained\Nby the police before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When an acquaintance of his\Nwas busted for using drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying the police traumatized him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, I picked it up Who\Npicks up a bloody knife? No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He claims he was planning to\Nturn it in to the police later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His claims are all hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you consider Owe's background,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fact he works as a live-in\Nemployee at a non-profit organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it definitely starts\Nsounding plausible to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of non-profit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shelter for the elderly\Nwho have nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They provide support for\Ntheir independent living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Owe's job was taking care of\Nthe residents who lived there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, they didn't pay\Nhim a salary with wages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They only supplied him\Nwith goods, like groceries,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boxed lunches, and gifts of pocket\Nmoney for New Year's sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you could believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.06,0:04:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they still charged him 50,000\Nyen a month for rent on his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, quite a few of the\Nresidents have prior records.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, when asked why he didn't turn\Nin the knife as soon as he found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules say we can't call cop cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or ambulances either they don't want\Nloud sirens bothering the neighbors
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a non-profit sounds pretty suspicious yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.90,0:04:34.42,Sign_Basic,WindowSign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord0\fs16\an5\move(151,160,264,160)\fay.15\c&H54B047&\frx2\fry350}Higuruma Law Office
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's extremely close to\Nbeing outright illegal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since the earthquake relief\Nfunds started flowing into this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,region we've seen an increase\Nin suspiciously managed npos
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's possible the murder\Nweapon was just lying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there i think there's a\Ngood chance that oa is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we'll investigate the\Norganization's activities and tax filings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then run background checks\Non all the residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll focus on getting more\Ninformation out of Oe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You handle the investigation, Shimizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dumping a huge job\Nlike that on me out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And could you take care\Nof his cat? His cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commission on a public defender case\Nis zilch, no matter how many hours we bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the public always\Nassumes they're guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, there's no suspended\Nsentence in murder cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he could get the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to gain\Nby taking this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will you please explain to me why you\Ngo around accepting cases like this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stuck to easy work,\Nour skills would dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than once in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying your\Nthoughts out loud again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Higuruma\Nhasn't changed a bit then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tough working for an independent\Nlawyer who isn't in it for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, at least I'm not stuck having\Nto run a cafe on the side like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you say he hasn't changed, you\Nmean Higuruma's always been like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm? Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he actually\Nused to be a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when he was with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was in charge of a reckless\Ndriving case that resulted in injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Specifically, it was for drunk driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The defendant was only 19,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his co-workers had\Ncoerced him into doing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both the drinking part\Nand the driving part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, those involved\Nall aligned their stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he didn't have the\Nmoney for a settlement,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we couldn't get him\Na suspended sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised me they\Nwould find me innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised to get him a suspended\Nsentence, not an innocent verdict,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although you didn't manage to\Ndo either, so there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what the takeaway from this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit being a criminal defense\Nlawyer for impossible cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to save the week\Nmay be a noble endeavor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's a limit to\Nwhat lawyers like us can do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without any cooperation from\Nthe courts and prosecutors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't want to sit and\Nhear a client's sob story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want to clear their dockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:07:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth continuing\Nwhen your clients resent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at the end of their rope,\Nboth mentally and financially.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't blame them for lashing out at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Higuruma, what\Nabout your mental state?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We, the people, find\Nthe defendant innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Innocent? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually won this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll appeal right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.90,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\b1\an7\fs16\shad0\bord3\c&H534B4B&\3c&HF6F6F6&}The Morioka Mother-Child Murder Incident\N{\b0\fs13}Questionable Innocent Verdict.\N"It Was Bought" \NFormer Judge Comments on Crooked Lawyer's Statements
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.71,0:08:02.42,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs13\an7\3c&HEBEBEB&\c&H000000&\shad0}The verdict was innocent.\NGuess even murderers go free\Nif they can pay up.\N\N How much did he dump on this...\N\N The law is dead. Prosecutors are useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.17,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,272)\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H4D2227&\3c&HF0ECEC&\shad0}Refusing to Accept the Current Ruling,\NThey Have Appealed Seeking A Revision
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.17,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&HECE8E9&\3c&H402C29&\shad0\pos(74,243.333)}Morioka Prosecutor's Office
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The prosecution is appealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the police searched your room for\Nstolen items, nothing was found there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the same non-profit residence,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another person went missing right\Nafter the crime was committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, you were caught on the\Nsecurity feet of a convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That and the condition\Nof the corpses proved you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couldn't have been at\Nthe scene of the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, it's a good thing you don't\Nknow how to cook for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to call me sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not in the clear yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still the appeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.01,0:08:46.21,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,250)\pos(546.667,85.333)\fs12\shad0\c&H3F403D&\3c&HFFFFFF&}I worked hard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who\Nbelieved me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.56,0:08:59.06,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,244)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HE3E3E3&\bord0\b1}Appeal Trial (Second Trial)
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.06,0:09:02.06,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,244)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HE3E3E3&\bord0\b1}Guilty. Life Sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While defense lawyers have to work\Nwith limited budgets and manpower,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prosecutors can use taxpayer money to pour\Non the lawyers and dig up the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's how the system works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the prosecutors didn't submit\Nany new evidence during the second trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The judge accepted their absurd claim that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was no reason to\Nconsider the missing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person as a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they overturned the verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The highest court is always the\Nbottleneck for a third trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most final appeals are\Nturned away at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to even get a proper trial there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This trial was destined for a\Nguilty verdict from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Higuruma, what\Nabout your mental state?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not trying to promote\Nthe ideals of saving the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just always gone\Nagainst my nature to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things alone when I\Nfeel like they're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just never been\Nable to fix that habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Goddess of Justice blinds her sight\Nto maintain fairness under the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and people turn a blind eye to all\Nkinds of things to protect themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to brush away the hands\Nof people who cling to me for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least I can do is keep my eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there are any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To today's trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submit your final appeal in writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within 15 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which includes today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having a retrial!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.57,0:11:16.52,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,244)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HE3E3E3&\bord0\b1}Culling Game Player
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.52,0:11:19.28,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,244)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HE3E3E3&\bord0\b1}Hiromi Higuruma
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinjuku. Ikebukuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? Shinjuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Itadori's headed there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikebukuro, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Fushiguro's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, isn't she running a little late\Nthat girl better get here soon or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if she doesn't have my next sucker\Nwith her, she'd better not come at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.01,0:11:47.01,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 55\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem no no no\Nno we asked the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing around here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting old
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you keeping quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better off laughing with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, what did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I actually told you,\Nbut why can't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't that smart or athletic,\Nbut they're brimming with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is just match their\Nattitude and joke around with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you don't hurt that ego of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you won't get targeted\Nby anyone else either and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might even have a good\Ntime now and then knock it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off hmm here comes another
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,idiot is that uniform from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,West Middle you're a middle\Nschool you need to learn some
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't be so violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.61,0:13:31.61,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,244)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HE3E3E3&\bord0\b1}Culling Game Player
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.75,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HE3E3E3&\bord0\b1\pos(320,40)\an8}Yuji Itadori\N Rin Amai
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't planning to go through\NIkebukuro to reach Shinjuku, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That area is rich with supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're more likely to\Nencounter other players.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two reasons for going this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The route is easy to follow, and\NI happen to have a base nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just dying to take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a chance\Nto rest since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma uses this theater as his base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assuming he hasn't moved, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been a big help, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait a minute. Hold up. Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're seriously going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd have preferred to go in\Nwith my friend, but I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never actually met Higuruma myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I once saw him beat Haba\Nto a pulp right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll totally be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat Propeller Head too, which means\NI'll at least be able to run away.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.22,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,525)\c&H4F32A6&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\shad0\fs12\b1\pos(325,182)}Maybe so
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should stop doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time, Higuruma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I guess we were\Nboth expecting to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she deceived you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just so you know, Reggie here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wasting my time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could ask you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever have the chance to take a bath\Nwhile still fully clothed? Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, it feels better\Nthan I expected it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, back when I\Nwas in elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved our safety classes\Non swimming and clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many things have stopped\Nmattering to me lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I've been challenging myself to\Ntry things I assumed I shouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've basically gone off the\Nrails after hitting my mid-30s.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's kind of amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Higuruma, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to be a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 30 minutes, I charge 5,000 yen to\Nconsult, so either pay up or shut up. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see what it feels\Nlike to be a cutthroat lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this guy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have a hundred\Npoints, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a past sorcerer\Nwho's been incarnated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:17:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a modern sorcerer whose\Ntechnique was activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can talk it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's room for negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you've passed the\Ntest with fine covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got more than enough, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite the Shikigami you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were weak, I'd just kill\Nyou as another average mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't agree to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you proposing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do you actually know\Nso far about this culling game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It uses the cursed energy\Nof the players inside the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barriers to ferry the people\Nof Japan to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then changes them\Ninto something inhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I should stay quiet about Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know Kenjaku, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there had to be at least one\Nsorcerer connected to Kenjaku in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, to be frank, we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to stop the culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say stop the game, I\Nmean stop the obligated killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could use your hundred points, we'd\Nbe able to add a new rule to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permit me to be frank as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that another joke? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just sense huge potential in letting\Nthe culling game continue as is.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.70,0:18:24.16,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(263.333,300.667)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs12\shad0\c&H66A4A3&\3c&H55524C&\frx336\fry332\frz341.3}Complete Book of the Six Codes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the law is powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, think about the\Nrules of this culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the power I've been granted is\Nreal, then those rules must be too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think all your talk about players' cursed\Nenergy being used inside the barriers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably just a bluff. A bluff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, less of a bluff and more,\Nlike you're describing Plan B or C.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's three reasons why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number of players, the strength gap\Nbetween players, and the barrier's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If roughly 1,000 people were equally\Nsplit up between the 10 colonies,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would come out to\N100 people per colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, among the players are\Nsources like Kashimo or Higuruma,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who are much stronger than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two alone have already\Nculled 60 sorcerers between them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I bet you there's a sorcerer just\Nlike them in each of the other colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then the weak are weeded out early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the culling\Ngame ends as a stalemate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's confirmed my suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The colony's been too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it has here in Tokyo No. 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of that, there's the teleportation\Nwhen people enter the colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It serves to spread out\Nplayers as they enter the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but its main goal is\Nlikely to encourage an
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,early second awakening\Nof modern sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some who die during\Nthe teleportation, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.96,0:19:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if he was really trying to\Nuse the players' cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he would probably\Nwant the greatest number of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorcerers to fight for\Nthe longest time possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if people who broke\Nthe rules were punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not with the need of\Nindictments, prosecutions,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or arguments at trials, but\Nby pure physics instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you there's issues\Nwith the current rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I want to watch over the system\Nserving as a basis for this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll ruin everything if it ends too soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.81,0:20:16.56,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\fs13\b1\c&H000000&\3c&H4836D1&\shad0}2: Players breaching the first rule\Nshall be stripped of their technique.\N8:  Players who do not show a change in points\Nwithin 19 days of joining or acquiring points\Nshall be stripped of their technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd especially love to\Nwitness at least once the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stripping of a technique\Nmentioned in Rules 2 and 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's better for the rules if\Nbeing stripped means death, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cullingame itself\Nis considered a ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we take too long, every\Nperson in this nation will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cullingame insists on\Nits own ongoing longevity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really get that part either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll rephrase it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me use your 100 points, Higuruma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever killed someone\Nwho really ticked you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hell of a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.14,0:20:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Shikigami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma has 100 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might have killed 20 sorcerers already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just recklessly jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go on defense, but I'll be\Nready to respond to any attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly sentencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea of a rule not hindering\Nthe continuation of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just a cover for the real plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when only the strong remain,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenjaku is going to drop a\Nbomb on this competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Culling Game\Nwill fulfill its purpose.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.83,0:21:56.58,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,295)\b1\shad0\bord0\1a&H30&}Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.71,0:22:07.34,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,295)\b1\shad0\bord0\1a&H30&}Thank you for inviting me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.94,0:22:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, make your argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I'm judged guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judge man, please begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean I can lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get one chance to make a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he hold his own against\Nme without cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what a retrial!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.99,0:23:55.06,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Next Episode\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 3
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time!

